# The workspace is a developer convenience only — the `require` lines in each
# service's go.mod are the source of truth (there are no `replace` directives
# for the fil-forge libraries), so builds are correct with GOWORK=off (which is
# what CI and the container builds use). Keeping the sum file out of git avoids
# churn that would otherwise land on every dependency bump — but it also means
# `go work sync` can leave a module's go.sum incomplete for GOWORK=off builds;
# run `go mod tidy` in each module after syncing.
go.work.sum

# goreleaser output, per service
*/dist/
